lt=\"S C Shettar client logo\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-auto max-h-16 w-auto max-w-full object-contain\"/></div><div class=\"logo-tile flex h-24 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white p-5\"><img src=\"/client-logos/client-logo-35-shree-nandi-properties.png\" alt=\"Shree Nandi Properties client logo\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-auto max-h-16 w-auto max-w-full object-contain\"/></div><div class=\"logo-tile flex h-24 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white p-5\"><img src=\"/client-logos/client-logo-36-svt-logo.jpg\" alt=\"SVT client logo\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-auto max-h-16 w-auto max-w-full object-contain\"/></div><div class=\"logo-tile flex h-24 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white p-5\"><img src=\"/client-logos/client-logo-37-triumph-logo.png\" alt=\"Triumph client logo\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-auto max-h-16 w-auto max-w-full object-contain\"/></div><div class=\"logo-tile flex h-24 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white p-5\"><img src=\"/client-logos/client-logo-38-tvs-motors-logo.png\" alt=\"TVS Motors client logo\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-auto max-h-16 w-auto max-w-full object-contain\"/></div><div class=\"logo-tile flex h-24 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white p-5\"><img src=\"/client-logos/client-logo-39-vajram.png\" alt=\"Vajram client logo\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-auto max-h-16 w-auto max-w-full object-contain\"/></div><div class=\"logo-tile flex h-24 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white p-5\"><img src=\"/client-logos/client-logo-40-varenya-logo.png\" alt=\"Varenya client logo\" width=\"150\" height=\"70\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"h-auto max-h-16 w-auto max-w-full object-contain\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section bg-[#F7F5F0] text-[#14202B]\"><div class=\"container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Diagnostic review</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:text-5xl\">Running Ads Is Easy. Generating the Right Leads Is Not.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[#465464]\">Advertising becomes expensive when campaigns generate activity without creating dependable business opportunities. The problem is rarely one setting. It is usually the connection between targeting, creative, intent, tracking and follow-up.</p><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"button button-dark mt-7\">Talk to a Performance Strategist <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"diagnostic-flow grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><article class=\"diagnostic-card light-panel rounded-md p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px) scale(0.97)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#14202B]/10 pb-5\"><span class=\"text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#3E86F5]\">BUDGET EFFICIENCY</span><span class=\"font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-sm font-extrabold text-[#D6A64F]\">0<!-- -->1</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">High Spend, Low Confidence</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-[#465464]\">You are investing in advertising without clear visibility into what is producing meaningful enquiries.</p></article><article class=\"diagnostic-card light-panel rounded-md p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px) scale(0.97)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#14202B]/10 pb-5\"><span class=\"text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#3E86F5]\">LEAD QUALITY</span><span class=\"font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-sm font-extrabold text-[#D6A64F]\">0<!-- -->2</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">Too Many Junk Leads</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-[#465464]\">A high enquiry count means little when your sales team spends time filtering weak or irrelevant leads.</p></article><article class=\"diagnostic-card light-panel rounded-md p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px) scale(0.97)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#14202B]/10 pb-5\"><span class=\"text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#3E86F5]\">FUNNEL STRUCTURE</span><span class=\"font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-sm font-extrabold text-[#D6A64F]\">0<!-- -->3</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">No Clear Conversion Path</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-[#465464]\">Campaigns struggle when ads, landing experiences and follow-up journeys operate without a connected strategy.</p></article><article class=\"diagnostic-card light-panel rounded-md p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px) scale(0.97)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#14202B]/10 pb-5\"><span class=\"text-xs font-extrabold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#3E86F5]\">DECISION MAKING</span><span class=\"font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-sm font-extrabold text-[#D6A64F]\">0<!-- -->4</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">Reports Without Direction</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-[#465464]\">Data becomes valuable only when it leads to practical campaign decisions and stronger business outcomes.</p></article><span class=\"diagnostic-flow-arrow diagnostic-flow-arrow-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.78)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"diagnostic-flow-arrow diagnostic-flow-arrow-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.78)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-corner-down-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 4v7a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H4\"></path><path d=\"m9 10-5 5 5 5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"diagnostic-flow-arrow diagnostic-flow-arrow-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.78)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"section bg-[#09111A]\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Performance architecture</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:text-5xl\">Specialised Services Built Around Lead Generation</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[#AFBAC7]\">We combine platform expertise with conversion thinking so advertising decisions are connected to the quality of opportunities your business receives.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel h-full rounded-lg p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\"><span class=\"h-1 w-16 rounded-full bg-[#D6A64F]\"></span><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">Meta Ads Management</h3><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">Strategic Facebook and Instagram campaigns designed to test the right messages, reach relevant audiences and generate stronger enquiry opportunities.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 grid gap-3 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Audience strategy</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Creative testing</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Retargeting pathways</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Lead form campaigns</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Performance optimisation</span></li></ul></div></article></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel h-full rounded-lg p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\"><span class=\"h-1 w-16 rounded-full bg-[#D6A64F]\"></span><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">Google Ads Management</h3><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">Intent-driven advertising designed to capture active demand through structured search campaigns, call-focused actions and conversion tracking.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 grid gap-3 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Search campaign structure</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Keyword strategy</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Call-focused campaigns</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Conversion measurement</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Search-term optimisation</span></li></ul></div></article></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel h-full rounded-lg p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\"><span class=\"h-1 w-16 rounded-full bg-[#D6A64F]\"></span><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">Lead Generation Funnels</h3><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">A connected enquiry journey that aligns your ads, landing experience and conversion actions around qualified lead generation.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 grid gap-3 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Funnel mapping</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Landing-page planning</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>CTA improvement</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Lead-capture strategy</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Enquiry quality review</span></li></ul></div></article></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel h-full rounded-lg p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\"><span class=\"h-1 w-16 rounded-full bg-[#D6A64F]\"></span><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">Campaign Audit and Strategy</h3><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">A structured review of targeting, creative direction, tracking, funnel logic and budget allocation to uncover missed opportunities.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 grid gap-3 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Account review</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Targeting review</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Funnel diagnosis</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Budget observations</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Recommended roadmap</span></li></ul></div></article></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-4\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel h-full rounded-lg p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\"><span class=\"h-1 w-16 rounded-full bg-[#D6A64F]\"></span><h3 class=\"mt-6 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-2xl font-extrabold\">Creative Production</h3><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">Campaign-focused visual production designed to help communicate value clearly across digital advertising placements.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 grid gap-3 text-sm\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Product photography</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Video production</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[#269B71]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Ad creative direction</span></li></ul></div></article></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"section bg-[#F7F5F0] text-[#14202B]\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Decision system</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:text-5xl\">A Clear Process Built Around Better Decisions</h2></div><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"button button-dark\">Start With a Strategy Discussion <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"process-route relative mt-14 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-5\"><div class=\"process-route-line hidden lg:block\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"process-route-current\"></span></div></div></div></section><section id=\"team\" class=\"section bg-[#101B27] text-[#F5F3EE]\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#D6A64F]\">The team</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:text-5xl\">The Growth Team Behind TAG Agency</h2></div><div class=\"mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/12 bg-[#09111A] shadow-2xl\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[12/5] min-h-[150px] bg-[#09111A] md:min-h-[240px]\"><img alt=\"TAG Agency team\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain md:object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 1180px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fteam-image.jpeg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section bg-[#09111A]\"><div class=\"container grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Agency focus</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:text-5xl\">Why a Specialist Agency Matters</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel rounded-md p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-xl font-extrabold\">Specialist Focus</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">Our focus is centred on Meta Ads, Google Ads and lead generation pathways rather than spreading attention across every possible service.</p></article></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel rounded-md p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-xl font-extrabold\">Strategy Before Spending</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">Campaign recommendations should begin with customer intent, business goals and conversion pathways.</p></article></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel rounded-md p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-xl font-extrabold\">Testing With Purpose</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">Creative, targeting and campaign testing are useful only when they improve decision making and enquiry quality.</p></article></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><article class=\"panel rounded-md p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-xl font-extrabold\">Transparent Improvement</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7 text-[#AFBAC7]\">Reporting should help businesses understand what changed, why it changed and what should happen next.</p></article></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"section relative overflow-hidden bg-[#F7F5F0] text-[#14202B]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#D6A64F]/60 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">About TAG Agency</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:text-5xl\">A Performance Agency Built Around Focus</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-[#465464] md:text-lg md:leading-8\">TAG Agency is a digital marketing agency focused on helping businesses grow through specialised paid advertising strategies. Our approach combines campaign execution, audience understanding, controlled testing and conversion-focused thinking to support real business growth.</p><p class=\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl border-l-2 border-[#D6A64F] pl-5 text-left font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-xl font-extrabold md:text-2xl\">Less noise. Better targeting. Smarter growth.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-3 text-left sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"group rounded-md border border-[#14202B]/12 bg-white p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#D6A64F]/50 hover:shadow-xl\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#3E86F5]/10 text-[#3E86F5] transition group-hover:bg-[#D6A64F]/15 group-hover:text-[#14202B]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-crosshair\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"18\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"2\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></span><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold\">Sharper targeting decisions</p><span class=\"signal-pulse mt-4 block h-px origin-left bg-gradient-to-r from-[#3E86F5] via-[#D6A64F] to-transparent\" style=\"animation-delay:0ms\"></span></div><div class=\"group rounded-md border border-[#14202B]/12 bg-white p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#D6A64F]/50 hover:shadow-xl\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#3E86F5]/10 text-[#3E86F5] transition group-hover:bg-[#D6A64F]/15 group-hover:text-[#14202B]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold\">Signal-led campaign review</p><span class=\"signal-pulse mt-4 block h-px origin-left bg-gradient-to-r from-[#3E86F5] via-[#D6A64F] to-transparent\" style=\"animation-delay:180ms\"></span></div><div class=\"group rounded-md border border-[#14202B]/12 bg-white p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#D6A64F]/50 hover:shadow-xl\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#3E86F5]/10 text-[#3E86F5] transition group-hover:bg-[#D6A64F]/15 group-hover:text-[#14202B]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold\">Controlled optimisation rhythm</p><span class=\"signal-pulse mt-4 block h-px origin-left bg-gradient-to-r from-[#3E86F5] via-[#D6A64F] to-transparent\" style=\"animation-delay:360ms\"></span></div><div class=\"group rounded-md border border-[#14202B]/12 bg-white p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#D6A64F]/50 hover:shadow-xl\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#3E86F5]/10 text-[#3E86F5] transition group-hover:bg-[#D6A64F]/15 group-hover:text-[#14202B]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-extrabold\">Performance conversations with context</p><span class=\"signal-pulse mt-4 block h-px origin-left bg-gradient-to-r from-[#3E86F5] via-[#D6A64F] to-transparent\" style=\"animation-delay:540ms\"></span></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"section bg-[#09111A]\"><div class=\"container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.82fr_1.18fr]\"><div class=\"panel rounded-lg p-6 md:p-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Strategy call</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 min-h-[9.6rem] font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight md:min-h-[7.5rem] md:text-5xl\" aria-label=\"Ready to Build a Stronger Lead Generation System?\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"typing-caret\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[#AFBAC7]\">Tell us about your business, current advertising activity and primary challenge. Our team will review your enquiry and connect with you for a focused strategy discussion.</p><ul class=\"mt-8 grid gap-3 text-sm font-semibold\"><li class=\"rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-4\">Focused discussion around your advertising challenge</li><li class=\"rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-4\">No inflated promises or generic recommendations</li><li class=\"rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-4\">Your details are used only to respond to your enquiry</li></ul></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)\"><form noValidate=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg bg-[#F7F5F0] p-5 text-[#14202B] shadow-2xl md:p-8\"><div class=\"mb-7\"><p class=\"text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#3E86F5]\">Qualified enquiry</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-[var(--font-manrope)] text-3xl font-extrabold\">Get a Free Ad account Audit</h3></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><label class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold \"><span>Full Name</span><input class=\"form-input\" autoComplete=\"name\" inputMode=\"text\" maxLength=\"80\" placeholder=\"Your full name\" required=\"\" name=\"fullName\"/></label><label class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold \"><span>Business Name</span><input class=\"form-input\" autoComplete=\"organization\" maxLength=\"120\" placeholder=\"Your business name\" required=\"\" name=\"businessName\"/></label><label class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold \"><span>Phone Number</span><input class=\"form-input\" autoComplete=\"tel-national\" inputMode=\"numeric\" maxLength=\"13\" placeholder=\"98765 43210\" required=\"\" name=\"phone\"/></label><label class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold \"><span>Email Address</span><input class=\"form-input\" autoComplete=\"email\" inputMode=\"email\" maxLength=\"254\" placeholder=\"you@business.com\" required=\"\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\"/></label><label class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold \"><span>Industry</span><select name=\"industry\" class=\"form-input\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\">Select industry</option><option>Real Estate</option><option>Automobile</option><option>Education</option><option>Healthcare</option><option>D2C / Ecommerce</option><option>Professional Services</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold \"><span>Monthly Advertising Budget</span><select name=\"monthlyBudget\" class=\"form-input\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\">Select budget</option><option>Not Started Yet</option><option>Below ₹25,000</option><option>₹25,000 to ₹50,000</option><option>₹50,000 to ₹1,00,000</option><option>₹1,00,000 to ₹3,00,000</option><option>Above ₹3,00,000</option></select></label><label class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold md:col-span-2\"><span>Primary Requirement</span><select name=\"primaryRequirement\" class=\"form-input\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\">Select requirement</option><option>Meta Ads Management</option><option>Google Ads Management</option><option>Lead Generation</option><option>Campaign Audit</option><option>Landing Page / Funnel Strategy</option><option>Creative Production</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold md:col-span-2\"><span>Message / Current Challenge</span><textarea name=\"message\" class=\"form-input min-h-32 resize-y\" maxLength=\"1500\" minLength=\"10\" placeholder=\"Tell us what you need help with\" required=\"\"></textarea></label></div><label class=\"mt-5 flex gap-3 text-sm font-semibold\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-1 h-5 w-5 accent-[#14202B]\" name=\"consent\"/><span>I agree to be contacted by TAG Agency regarding my enquiry.</span></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"button button-dark mt-6 w-full\">Get My Free Ad account Audit<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg></button><p class=\"mt-3 text-center text-xs text-[#465464]\">Your information is kept private and used only to respond to your enquiry.</p><div class=\"mt-4 min-h-6 text-center text-sm font-bold text-[#C35A4A]\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></form></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"bg-[#F7F5F0] py-12 text-[#14202B]\"><div class=\"container grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.7fr_0.8fr_0.7fr_1fr]\"><div><p class=\"max-w-sm leading-7 text-[#465464]\">Specialised Meta Ads, Google Ads and lead generation strategy for growth-focused businesses.</p><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-2 text-sm font-bold\"><a href=\"tel:+917411110987\">Call: <!-- -->7411110987</a><a href=\"https://wa.me/917411110987\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">WhatsApp: <!-- -->7411110987</a><di